AOPD research code release

The files preserve the authors' existing AOPD implementation and include code derived from:

- Hugging Face TRL (HuggingFace Team), Apache License 2.0. The retained OPSD trainer includes its original copyright header.
- On-Policy Self-Distillation / Self-Distilled Reasoner (Siyan Zhao et al., 2026), which builds on TRL GOLD. The original implementation supplies self-distillation prompts and training infrastructure; AOPD adds reward-group weighting, clipping and residual terms.
- VERL (ByteDance Ltd. and/or its affiliates), Apache License 2.0. Only the SandboxFusion reward client package is retained, from source revision 84e014b4c2ba2ec32c9a47fb85067454f90e8e82. Original copyright headers remain in external_teacher/sandbox_fusion/.

The Apache License 2.0 text is in licenses/Apache-2.0.txt. Dataset and model licenses remain with their respective publishers. The authors selected Apache License 2.0 for this repository.

MMLU-Pro formatter/parser helpers are retained from TIGER-AI-Lab/MMLU-Pro, source revision f418b116db00b065c2aea046518d8fcf74d39872, under Apache License 2.0; see licenses/Apache-2.0.txt.
